          "body": "First crack at some Analysis level javadocs.  All comments welcome.  Could use a bit more on best practices, maybe, but has a good intro, I think, to the main concepts.\n\nPlease let me know of changes by 6/14/07, otherwise I will commit to branch and trunk.\n",
